|_| |_||_.__/ |_.__/ |_|   |_| \__,_| \__, | \___|(_)|_| |_| |_||___/|_| |_| |_| \__, | \___| \__| \___|/_/\_\
                                      |___/                                      |___/

    The source code `hbbridge.MsMGetEx.tlpp` is based on a more detailed and feature-rich
    source code, `dna.tech.MsMGetEx.tlpp`, `sqltools.advpl.model.prw` and `dna.tech.sxb.conpad1.tlpp`, and implements part of the functionalities
    present in the latter.

Implements an MsMGet-style record view

Released to Public Domain.
